            <div xml:id="d67-a11">

                <pb facs="0476" n="464" xml:id="pg464"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 11]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Statement by the United Kingdom Delegation on Article
                        27</hi></head>
                <p>The United Kingdom Delegation support the text accepted by a simple majority in
                    the Commission.</p>
                <p>They can see no reason why the relative Article in the Treaty with Roumania
                    should differ from that agreed for the Italian Treaty and they would be
                    unwilling to be associated with such a differentiation particularly as there is
                    every intention to give Italy and Roumania the same treatment in Germany as
                    regards restitution and the restoration of property there.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
